{"id":"630874","name":"肉末虾仁生煎包","author":"どら","authorId":"10454906","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/630874/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"肉末","amount":"适量"},{"name":"虾仁","amount":"适量"},{"name":"低粉","amount":"500克"},{"name":"温水","amount":"250克"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"酵母粉","amount":"3克"},{"name":"盐","amount":"2克"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"2克"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"2克"},{"name":"白芝麻","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"温水划开酵母粉，低粉加入，揉成光滑面团。","img":"images/630874/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"盖上湿布发酵至两倍大。","img":"images/630874/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"肉末虾仁整理好放一起。","img":"images/630874/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"生抽，胡椒粉，盐。","img":"images/630874/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"搅拌均匀备用。","img":"images/630874/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"揉搓一下面团。","img":"images/630874/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"分别分成小剂子。","img":"images/630874/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"依次包好。","img":"images/630874/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"锅内刷底油。","img":"images/630874/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入生煎包。","img":"images/630874/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"调一碗水淀粉糊。","img":"images/630874/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"倒入锅内。","img":"images/630874/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"盖锅盖中小火焖。","img":"images/630874/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"分钟，表面撒葱花，白芝麻。","img":"images/630874/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"出锅，装盘。","img":"images/630874/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/630874/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"来一张。","img":"images/630874/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}